格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Universal image generation router for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): auto-discovers image models from any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Supports SenseNova, StepFun, Agnes, Qwen, Flux, SD, Imagen and more. | DeepSeek Harness 统一绘图路由器","id":"gh:1335012435","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-draw-router","slug":"xiaozhe7772222/dsh-draw-router","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","image-generation","text-to-image"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Universal image generation router for DeepSeek Harness (DSH): auto-discovers image models from any O"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"penAI-compatible endpoint. Supports SenseNova, StepFun, Agnes, Qwen, Flux, SD, Imagen and more. | De"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"epSeek Harness 统一绘图路由器"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-draw-router"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness 缺少生图能力？这个插件让它能。**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness (DSH) can't generate images? This plugin fixes that.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 🐧 **Designed & built by 小哲** (@xiaozhe7772222)\n>\n> **Author:** 小哲 (xiaozhe7772222) 🐧 · **Maintaine"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"r:** 小哲 (xiaozhe7772222) 🐧"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"填一个 baseURL + API Key → 自动识别绘图模型 → 对话中直接生图"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Add a baseURL + API Key → auto-detect image models → draw from chat"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### The Problem"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness (DSH)** is a powerful LLM agent framework, but it has **no built-in image generat"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ion capability**. You can't ask the agent to draw a picture, create a diagram, or generate a visual "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"— it simply doesn't know how."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**dsh-draw-router** solves this by acting as a **universal image generation router**. It registers `"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"draw_image` and `draw_list_sources` as agent tools, so the DSH agent can generate images just like i"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"t runs bash commands — naturally, in conversation."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### ✨ Features"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| 🎨 **Agent-native image gen** | DSH agent can draw images on demand — just ask \"画一张图\" |\n| 🔍 **Auto "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"model discovery** | Enter any OpenAI-compatible `baseURL` + API key → plugin calls `GET /v1/models` "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"and auto-detects image models (never hardcodes model names) |\n| 🏭 **Multi-provider** | SenseNova · S"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"tepFun · Agnes · Qwen · Tongyi Wanxiang · Jimeng/Seedream · Hunyuan · GPT Image · Flux · Stable Diff"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"usion · Imagen · and any OpenAI-compatible endpoint |\n| 🎚️ **Manual model add** | For providers not "},{"id":"p15s6","text":"exposing image models via `/v1/models`, add models manually |\n| 🔌 **REST API** | Add/remove/probe dr"},{"id":"p15s7","text":"aw sources at runtime; draw via `POST /dsh-draw-router/draw` |\n| 💾 **Persistent config** | Sources p"},{"id":"p15s8","text":"ersist to `draw-config.json`, survive restarts |\n| 🔒 **Key masking** | API responses never expose fu"},{"id":"p15s9","text":"aw-config.json`, survive restarts |\n| 🔒 **Key masking** | API responses never expose full API keys |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 🧠 How it works"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**Model detection works by name pattern matching** — no hardcoded model lists. The plugin recognizes"},{"id":"p18s2","text":" 30+ patterns including `image`, `draw`, `generation`, `flux`, `sd-3`, `hunyuan`, `seedream`, `agnes"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"-image`, `step-image`, `qwen-image`, `wan`, `imagen`, `gpt-image`, `dall`, `t2i`, `i2i` and more."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Each provider's API quirks are handled automatically (per official docs):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Provider | Auto-detected models | Special handling |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| **SenseNova** (商汤) | `sensenova-u1-fast` | Standard OpenAI format |\n| **StepFun** (阶跃) | `step-ima"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ge-edit-2`, `step-2x-large` | `steps`, `cfg_scale`, `negative_prompt` |\n| **Agnes** | `agnes-image-2"},{"id":"p21s3","text":".1-flash`, `2.0-flash` | `size` tiers `1K-4K`, `ratio` |\n| **TokenRhythm / Qwen** | Manual add | Sta"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ndard OpenAI format |\n| **DashScope** (阿里云百炼) | `wanx-v1`, `wan2.6-t2i` | Async task + polling |\n| *"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"*GPT Image** | `gpt-image-1.5`, `dall-e-3` | Standard OpenAI format |\n| **Flux** | `flux-2-pro`, `fl"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ux.1-dev` | Standard OpenAI format |\n| **Stable Diffusion** | `sd-3.5-large`, `stable-image-ultra` |"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" Standard OpenAI format |\n| **Hunyuan** (混元) | `hunyuan-image-3.0` | Standard OpenAI format |\n| **Se"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"edream** (即梦/豆包) | `seedream-4.x` | Standard OpenAI format |\n| **Imagen** | `imagen-4` | Standard Op"},{"id":"p21s9","text":"豆包) | `seedream-4.x` | Standard OpenAI format |\n| **Imagen** | `imagen-4` | Standard OpenAI format |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### 🏗️ Architecture"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"### 📦 Installation"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Two installation methods are supported."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"#### Method A: File-based installation (推荐 / Recommended)"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Clone the repo and copy files:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"#### Method B: Terminal command installation (终端命令安装)"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Install directly via the DSH CLI:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"After either method, restart DSH:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Verify it's working:"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### ⚙️ Configuration"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"#### Option 1: Static config via `cordis.patch.yml`"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"> **baseURL hint**: give the API root (e.g. `https://api.stepfun.com/v1`). The plugin appends `/imag"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"es/generations` and `/models` automatically."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"#### Option 2: REST API (runtime)"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"### 🔌 REST API Reference"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| Endpoint | Method | Body | Description |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| `/dsh-draw-router/sources` | GET | — | List all sources + detected image models |\n| `/dsh-draw-rou"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"ter/sources` | POST | `{action:\"add\", name, baseUrl, apiKey}` | Add a source & probe models |\n| `/ds"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"h-draw-router/sources` | POST | `{action:\"remove\", name}` | Remove a source |\n| `/dsh-draw-router/so"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"urces` | POST | `{action:\"probe\", name}` | Re-probe models |\n| `/dsh-draw-router/sources` | POST | `"},{"id":"p44s5","text":"{action:\"addModel\", name, model}` | Add a manual model |\n| `/dsh-draw-router/sources` | POST | `{act"},{"id":"p44s6","text":"ion:\"removeModel\", name, model}` | Remove a model |\n| `/dsh-draw-router/draw` | POST | `{source, pro"},{"id":"p44s7","text":"mpt, model?, size?, ratio?, n?, response_format?}` | Generate an image |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### ✨ 功能特性"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| 功能 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"| 🎨 **Agent 原生生图** | Agent 可按需生图——一句\"画一张图\"即可 |\n| 🔍 **自动识别模型** | 填入任意 OpenAI 兼容的 `baseURL` + API Key "},{"id":"p47s2","text":"→ 插件调用 `GET /v1/models` 自动识别绘图模型（不预设模型名） |\n| 🏭 **多厂商支持** | 商汤 · 阶跃 · Agnes · 千问 · 通义万相 · 即梦/Seedream"},{"id":"p47s3","text":" · 混元 · GPT Image · Flux · Stable Diffusion · Imagen · 以及任意 OpenAI 兼容端点 |\n| 🎚️ **手动添加模型** | 对于不通过 `/"},{"id":"p47s4","text":"v1/models` 暴露绘图模型的厂商，可手动添加模型 |\n| 🔌 **REST API** | 运行时增删绘图源、探测模型、直接生图 |\n| 💾 **配置持久化** | 绘图源持久化到 `draw"},{"id":"p47s5","text":"-config.json`，重启后依然有效 |\n| 🔒 **Key 脱敏** | API 响应永不暴露完整 API Key |"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"### 🏗️ 系统架构"},{